 e musing by farmer Jai\, whose knowledge is expansive and excitement is in
 fectious. After your tasting\, you’ll spend time looking even closer at 
 your favorite selections of the farm’s yield. Seated in the farm’s lus
 h outdoor space\, instructor Hannah Day will walk you step by step through
