BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:River to Coast Children's Services 50th Anniversary Gala
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260829T200000
UID:851cd70c4baffba55ea31d8afd02e507@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 50 years of RCCS. Join your fellow community steward
 s under the redwoods for a farm-to-table dinner by master chef\, Jorge Sal
 dana. For fifty years\, River to Coast Children's Services(RCCS) has been 
 a cornerstone for families raising children in Western Sonoma County\, and
  we're celebrating that legacy and impact the way it deserves. Join your f
 ellow community stewards under the redwoods at the Sabor Mexicano farmhous
 e\, where string lights and garden grounds set the stage for an unforgetta
 ble evening. Dinner will be hand-crafted by Chef Jorge Saldana\, a renowne
 d culinary 30-year veteran behind two celebrated restaurants\, Cancun Sabo
 r Mexicano in downtown Berkeley and Tlaloc Sabor Mexicano in San Francisco
 's Financial District – bringing his farm-to-table recipes to your table
  for one night only. Come honor five decades of impact\, celebrate the com
 munity that has supported us\, and look ahead to the next fifty years of h
 elping local families.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/river-to-coast-children
 -s-services-50th-anniversary-gala
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
